            "text": "<p>CURRENT VERSIONS</p><ul><li><strong>iOS : 2.1.1</strong></li><li><strong>Android: 2.4.3</strong></li><li><strong>Thermometer firmware: v2.2.1</strong></li><li><strong>Display Firmware: v2.3.3</strong></li><li><strong>Booster Firmware: v2.3.3</strong></li></ul><p><strong>iOS app </strong>in the <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/combustion-inc/id1658858290\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/combustion-inc/id1658858290\">App Store </a></p><p><strong>Android app</strong> on <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=inc.combustion.app\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=inc.combustion.app\">Google Play</a></p>",
