        "text_cB6NGd": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We pushed the limits of what is possible, and some of those limits pushed back. Real-world testing revealed some limitations in the physical product - stuff we didn’t discover until we had more people cooking with different appliances in a wider variety of different ways. </p><p>Some of these issues can be fixed, but some are bumping up against the laws of physics and thermodynamics and we just need to work around them. </p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
