        "text_bFATrG": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>You will find answers to questions you didn't even know you had on the <a href=\"https://combustion.inc/pages/faq\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://combustion.inc/pages/faq\">main FAQ.</a> </p><p>If you have other questions about cooking with the Predictive Thermometer, your best bet is to ask on <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/combustion_inc/\" title=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/combustion_inc/\">our official subreddit.</a> (Chris - our founder - watches this and often responds personally.)</p><p><strong>Please write us if you have a problem or would like to report an issue. </strong><a href=\"mailto:support@combustion.inc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@combustion.inc\">(support@combustion.inc)</a> </p><p>Your feedback is super-important, it’s a big part of how we find ways to improve the product. </p><p>Thanks for taking the time, we really appreciate it. </p><p><strong>Happy Cooking!</strong></p>",
